{"files": [{"id": 26230875, "name": "pgen.1009285.g007.tif", "size": 1697464, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/26230875", "supplied_md5": "e1a7ac940d4c42b03c0f7c430317555e", "computed_md5": "e1a7ac940d4c42b03c0f7c430317555e", "mimetype": "image/tiff"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 8356980, "full_name": "Brian T. Emmer", "first_name": "Brian T.", "last_name": "Emmer", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 10053054, "full_name": "Emily J. Sherman", "first_name": "Emily J.", "last_name": "Sherman", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 8356983, "full_name": "Paul J. Lascuna", "first_name": "Paul J.", "last_name": "Lascuna", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 10053057, "full_name": "Sarah E. Graham", "first_name": "Sarah E.", "last_name": "Graham", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 7800014, "full_name": "Cristen J. Willer", "first_name": "Cristen J.", "last_name": "Willer", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 402494, "full_name": "David Ginsburg", "first_name": "David", "last_name": "Ginsburg", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://plos.figshare.com/articles/figure/Disruption_of_the_exocyst_causes_a_discordant_effect_on_HuH7_uptake_of_LDL_and_transferrin_/13666788", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p>(A) Average log2-fold change +/- SEM for the 15 gRNA in our secondary CRISPR library targeting each exocyst component in selected populations. Reduction in gRNA frequency reflects a decrease in LDL or transferrin uptake or LDLR staining. (B) Allele genotypes from individual HuH7 clones isolated after CRISPR targeting of either <i>EXOC4</i> or <i>EXOC8</i>. (C) Immunoblotting of lysates prepared from wild-type HuH7 cells, or <i>EXOC4</i><sup><i>-25/-2</i></sup> or <i>EXOC8</i><sup><i>-4/+2</i></sup> clones with and without ectopic lentiviral expression of a <i>EXOC4</i> or <i>EXOC8</i> CRISPR-resistant cDNA. (D) LDL uptake assay and (E) transferrin uptake assay of WT, <i>LDLR</i><sup>+1/+1</sup>, and <i>EXOC4</i><sup><i>-25/-2</i></sup> or <i>EXOC8</i><sup><i>-4/+2</i></sup> clones with and without ectopic expression of a CRISPR-resistant cDNA. * = <i>p</i> < 0.05.</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 1697464, "created_date": "2021-01-29T18:43:04Z", "modified_date": "2023-06-10T00:42:03Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["modifiable risk factor", "LDL uptake Hypercholesterolemia", "gRNA", "LDL uptake modifiers", "HuH 7 cells", "Candidate LDL uptake regulators", "LDL uptake", "genome-scale CRISPR screening", "Genome-scale CRISPR screening", "LDLR"], "keywords": ["modifiable risk factor", "LDL uptake Hypercholesterolemia", "gRNA", "LDL uptake modifiers", "HuH 7 cells", "Candidate LDL uptake regulators", "LDL uptake", "genome-scale CRISPR screening", "Genome-scale CRISPR screening", "LDLR"], "categories": [{"id": 4, "title": "Biochemistry", "parent_id": 38, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 8, "title": "Microbiology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 12, "title": "Cell Biology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 13, "title": "Genetics", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 14, "title": "Molecular Biology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 19, "title": "Pharmacology", "parent_id": 48, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10}, {"id": 272, "title": "Environmental Sciences not elsewhere classified", "parent_id": 33, "path": "", "source_id": "", "taxonomy_id": 10